{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00633","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 承光舞 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 承光舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金相载穆，玉裕重辉。\n养德清禁，承光紫微。\n乾宫候色，震象增威。\n监国方永，宾天不归。\n孝友自衷，温文性与。\n龙楼正啓，鹤驾斯举。\n丹扆流念，鸿名式序。\n中兴考室，永陈彝俎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00633.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00633","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}